3
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:13,240
I'm Doctor Gainz. Lesson 17: Create a
document request and handoff

4
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:17,720
packet. A document request should explain
the purpose of each requested

5
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:22,060
item. Use the supplied case reference and
ask for copies through a suitable

6
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:27,240
secure channel. Avoid requesting a full
identity, banking, or family record

7
00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:29,800
bundle merely because it might be useful
later.

8
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:33,880
Keep originals with the person unless an
appropriate process requires

9
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:38,740
otherwise. A handoff packet can contain an
index, client authorization

10
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:44,220
scope, sale/process classification, a
dated event log, source-linked

11
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:48,280
accounting figures, unresolved questions,
and the next review requested.

12
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:51,620
Flag incomplete or inconsistent material.

13
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:56,140
Never hide a competing claim, an expired-
date concern, or an access

14
00:00:56,140 --> 00:00:57,560
restriction from the reviewer.

15
00:00:57,560 --> 00:01:02,160
The course downloads include an
administrative checklist, not an operative

16
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:06,140
legal claim, fee agreement, assignment, or
power of attorney.

17
00:01:06,620 --> 00:01:10,720
A locally qualified professional should
select and review any required legal

18
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:12,780
instruments for the actual circumstances.

19
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:14,960
Pause and try this.

20
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:19,540
Prepare a fictional handoff index with a
source column and a missing-item

21
00:01:19,540 --> 00:01:22,820
column. Explain why each requested item is
relevant.

22
00:01:22,820 --> 00:01:27,860
Quick knowledge check. Which document is
supplied as a universal legal

23
00:01:27,860 --> 00:01:29,180
instrument by this course?

24
00:01:30,020 --> 00:01:34,140
The answer: None; the worksheets are
administrative learning aids.

25
00:01:34,700 --> 00:01:38,400
Administrative worksheets do not replace
jurisdiction-specific legal

26
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:43,660
documents or authority. Keep the source,
the date, and the unknowns visible.

27
00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:45,460
I'll see you in the next lesson.
